msgid "与卡片 UI 的“晶格”分组一致。这些卡片负责生成晶体原型、扩胞，或者系统改变晶胞的 长度、角度与形状。它们与只移动原子坐标的“扰动”卡片分开。"
msgstr ""
"This section matches the `Lattice` group in the card picker. These cards generate "
"crystal prototypes, expand cells, or systematically change cell lengths, angles, and "
"shapes. They are separate from `Perturbations` cards, which move atomic coordinates "
"without scanning the cell."

